      {
        "text": "How is it that ye have not hearkened unto the word of the Lord?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Nephi 7:9",
        "book": "1 Nephi",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "How is it that ye have forgotten that ye have seen an angel of the Lord?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 32,
            "text": "Deut. 4:9 (9–13); 1 Ne. 4:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Nephi 7:10",
        "book": "1 Nephi",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, and how is it that ye have forgotten what great things the Lord hath done for us, in delivering us out of the hands of Laban, and also that we should obtain the record?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 90,
            "end": 100,
            "text": "1 Ne. 4:1 (1–38)."
